; run: %atomic_and(0xC0FFEEEE_ABCDEF01_DECAFFFF_12345678, 0xFEDCBA98_76543210_F7E6D5C4_B3A29180) == [0xC0DCAA88_22442200_D6C2D5C4_12201000, 0xC0FFEEEE_ABCDEF01_DECAFFFF_12345678]


